NetSurf 3.12 development build for OPENSTEP Intel

NetSurf uses GPL version 2 with the OpenSSL linking exception in
NetSurf-COPYING. Keep the binary and matching source archives available
together. The source archive includes the application, dependency source
archives, OPENSTEP patches, and build scripts. See BUILDING.txt.

Included software and license texts (relative to Resources/Licenses):
